{
  "id": "BiblioNotify0001",
  "name": "Bibliotheca · Notificaciones y recordatorios",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "bibliotheca-notify",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3e19ffcd-6c5f-4622-b202-5f5e685ecceb",
      "name": "Webhook notificaciones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "5b0c3a7e-6f1d-4c38-9a51-0b1b11e7ec4a"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Llega desde notifications-service: { chatId, text, parseMode, inlineKeyboard, type }\nconst b = $json.body || {};\nif (!b.chatId || !b.text) return [];\nconst out = { chatId: String(b.chatId), text: String(b.text).slice(0, 4000) };\nif (Array.isArray(b.inlineKeyboard) && b.inlineKeyboard.length) out.replyMarkup = { inline_keyboard: b.inlineKeyboard };\nreturn [{ json: out }];"
      },
      "id": "bede9cfd-5dc1-4bd2-bebe-7e3e55a15a63",
      "name": "Preparar mensaje",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.telegram.org/bot{{ $env.TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN }}/sendMessage",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": false
            }
          }
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ chat_id: $json.chatId, text: $json.text, parse_mode: 'HTML', disable_web_page_preview: true, reply_markup: $json.replyMarkup }) }}"
      },
      "id": "7b57e984-6ced-4760-89c2-9e789ef651ac",
      "name": "Enviar a Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9,18 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "eeba5203-7e66-40fc-a402-8ce5c5e3f9c6",
      "name": "Todos los días 9:00 y 18:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.LOANS_URL }}/internal/jobs/reminders",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": false
            }
          }
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-key",
              "value": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ daysAhead: 2 }) }}"
      },
      "id": "b04008a3-ca4a-4996-8583-19e8c7dc3986",
      "name": "Generar recordatorios",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔔 Notificaciones\n**Arriba:** notifications-service llama a este webhook (`/webhook/bibliotheca-notify`) y el mensaje sale por Telegram con botones (p. ej. *Renovar*).\n\n**Abajo:** dos veces al día se le pide a loans-service que publique `loan.due_soon` y `loan.overdue`; esos eventos regresan por aquí convertidos en recordatorios.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "f89d3fa5-0faf-412b-91f1-4f873341e461",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook notificaciones": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Preparar mensaje",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Preparar mensaje": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Enviar a Telegram",
            "type": "main",
